Trademark
---------
The MIT licence grants rights to the code, not to the upstream project's name
or marks. The package is therefore distributed under the name
`dsh-meeting-studio` with its own icon; the upstream name is used only to
credit the origin, as above.

Brand
-----
`icon.svg` and `locale/*.json` are our own brand, not upstream's: the mark is
the icon form of the Dokimel AI identity (three stacked frames, side ratio 0.7,
1/3 corner press, 12° skew; three-step grey with green on the top frame only),
taken from the company design source `Dokimel-标志规范-V9.0/svg/`
`b-prod-icon32-paper.svg` (kept outside this repository) and the §3 paper
palette (#8E8F94 / #69696F / #007A4D), scaled onto the host's 36-unit artwork
canvas. Scope: this package's icon and locale text only — the mark belongs to
四川明策智算科技有限公司, is not derived from the upstream project, and the MIT
grant above covers code, not the mark.
